  "revision": "world-v5: crowned stepping stones, four rounded hero boulders, portable leaf color gradients",
  "triangle_budget": 400000,
  "design_changes": [
    "Existing stepping-stone positions and footprints retained with a shallow curved crown and worn double shoulder. All components remain closed shared topology.",
    "Four rounded weathered boulders sit outside route corridors in one Garden_HeroBoulders mesh; existing materials only, with integrated moss patches.",
    "BL_FoliageTint vertex colors grade existing blades from approximately 0.78 at roots to 1.0 at tips. Other meshes are white. No added vegetation geometry or materials.",
    "Existing layout, all 14 anchors, cabin, lamps, targets and spawn remain unchanged. No new textures; ground textures regenerate identically to world-v4-r1.",
    "33 coincident duplicate triangles in legacy flower poles are removed before interchange export; zero-area triangles are also checked. Maximum total budget remains 400000 triangles."
  ],
